<div align="center">

# 🌃 Smart Street Light (LDR + PIR)
### *Automatic Street Lighting System using Light & Motion Detection*

</div>

---

# 🎯 Objective

Develop an intelligent street light system using an **LDR (Light Dependent Resistor)** and a **PIR Motion Sensor** that automatically controls street lighting based on ambient light and human movement.

---

# ✨ Key Features

🌞 **Day Mode**
- Street light remains **OFF**
- Motion sensor is disabled

🌙 **Night Mode**
- Motion detection becomes active
- System continuously monitors for movement

🚶 **Motion Detection**
- LED turns **ON at full brightness (100%)**
- Motion timer starts

💤 **Power Saving Mode**
- If no motion is detected for **30 seconds**
- LED automatically dims to **20% brightness**

📟 **Real-Time Logging**
- Every event is displayed on the **Serial Monitor**
- Includes timestamps for easy monitoring

---

# 🛠️ Components Required

| Component | Quantity |
|:-------------------------|:--------:|
| Arduino Uno | 1 |
| LDR (Photoresistor) | 1 |
| 10kΩ Resistor | 1 |
| PIR Motion Sensor (HC-SR501) | 1 |
| LED | 1 |
| 220Ω Resistor | 1 |
| Breadboard | 1 |
| Jumper Wires | As Required |

---

# 🔌 Circuit Connections

| Component | Arduino Pin |
|:---------------------------|:-----------:|
| LDR Output | **A0** |
| PIR Output | **D2** |
| LED (+) | **D9 (PWM)** |
| LED (-) | **GND** |

---

# ⚙️ System Workflow

## 🌞 Daytime Operation

- LDR detects sufficient sunlight.
- LED remains **OFF**.
- PIR sensor input is ignored.

---

## 🌙 Nighttime Operation

- LDR detects low light conditions.
- Motion detection is activated.

---

## 🚶 Motion Detected

- LED switches to **100% brightness**.
- 30-second inactivity timer resets.

---

## 💤 No Motion for 30 Seconds

- LED brightness decreases to **20%**.
- Conserves energy while maintaining visibility.

---

# 📟 Sample Serial Monitor Output

```text
[00:00:02] EVENT: Night detected - Motion Detection Enabled
[00:00:07] EVENT: Motion detected - LED ON (100%)
[00:00:38] EVENT: No motion for 30 seconds - LED Dimmed (20%)
[00:10:12] EVENT: Daylight detected - Street Light OFF
```

