# ✅ Expected Result

✔️ Street light remains **OFF** during the daytime.

✔️ Motion detection is enabled automatically at night.

✔️ LED glows at **100% brightness** whenever motion is detected.

✔️ After **30 seconds** of no movement, LED brightness reduces to **20%**.

✔️ Every system event is logged to the **Serial Monitor** with timestamps.

✔️ Circuit schematic is saved in:

```text
/week3/schematics/
```

